Senator Imee R. Marcos: from a past life.

1207
00:44:42,960 --> 00:44:43,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Day one,

1208
00:44:44,380 --> 00:44:44,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President,

1209
00:44:45,200 --> 00:44:45,660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: first day.

1210
00:44:46,160 --> 00:44:47,360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So there is no funding

1211
