1369
00:55:52,720 --> 00:55:56,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because if, I mean, that's what it means, Mr. President.

1370
00:55:56,680 --> 00:56:00,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, gaya po ninyo, paibay ba talaga yung mga press release?

1371
00:56:01,460 --> 00:56:04,360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Paibay ba rin yung mga sinasabi ng mga leaders dito?

1372
00:56:04,780 --> 00:56:12,040
