Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: an ERC.

1405
00:57:43,380 --> 00:57:45,300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Siguro naman,

1406
00:57:45,620 --> 00:57:48,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi kayo gagawa ng proyekto na makaka-apekto sa...

1407
00:57:48,460 --> 00:57:49,420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kabuuhan ng Luzon.

1408
00:57:49,600 --> 00:57:51,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But this is a commitment, of course,

1409
00:57:51,680 --> 00:57:54,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that they will have to go through the proper regulations

1410
00:57:54,380 --> 00:57:59,180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and with the proper understanding that this project is self-generated,

1411
