Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I think the proper venue would be the Committee on the Whole to go into detail about all of these issues being raised also.

1509
01:04:21,040 --> 01:04:25,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, which is why we need to get that scheduled impeachment or budget.

