01:04:25,180 --> 01:04:30,420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: in, uh, um, [unclear] aside.

1511
01:04:30,420 --> 01:04:39,500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, BCDA provides that guarantee, and I hope no Filipino taxpayer will be required to subsidize the water requirements of PacSilica,

1512
01:04:39,920 --> 01:04:45,940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which should, instead of burdening us, help us develop our manufacturing capability.

1513
