Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For transparency and to really share with the people, ano ba talaga yung mga nakaplano dito, no?

1518
01:05:04,980 --> 01:05:07,220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And marami pong concerns, no?

1519
