Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There was a recent survey result that came out that majority were not in favor of this initiative.

1520
01:05:14,280 --> 01:05:20,420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And clarity, I think, will help people understand better kung dapat ba itong masuporta o hindi.

1521
01:05:20,920 --> 01:05:27,140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we have asked, even from the first hearing, our friends from BCDA, and BOI, si Yusek Rodolfo,

